<Games title="Shelf Brawlers" description="A cozy-chaotic toy-shop roguelite: unbox a vinyl figure and brawl through a toy shop after dark.">
  <img src="/games/shelf-brawlers/feature.webp" alt="Shelf Brawlers" width="1024" height="500" style="border-radius:var(--radius);margin-bottom:24px" />
  <h1>Shelf Brawlers</h1>
  <p>When the toy shop closes for the night, the vinyl figures on the shelf come alive, and so does the grumpy junk in the stockroom. Unbox a random figure, then brawl through three floors of the shop: grumpy jack-in-the-boxes, rubber ducks, wind-up soldiers, glowing elite squads and six bosses. Every run you pick new gifts to build something wild. Runs take about 12 minutes, played with one thumb.</p>
